            "id": "B12.trust",
            "title": "Claude Code trusts the repo for background agents",
            "description": "Background agents start in the main checkout, and Claude Code only starts one in a folder you've trusted. VSCode's own Claude sessions don't record this, so it takes one run of claude in a terminal.\n\n[Check](command:acc.step.check?%5B%22B12.trust%22%5D)\n[Do it](command:acc.step.fix?%5B%22B12.trust%22%5D)",
